/Title (Staying productive is hard and distractions are everywhere. The Pomodoro Technique is one of the most well-known ways to fight that, so for my university Software Architecture project, where we had to apply real software patterns and architecture in React and TypeScript, our team built PomodoroQuest, a web app that helps users improve focus, manage study or work sessions, and maintain a healthy balance between productivity and rest. I worked on the timer frontend, from building the core countdown logic and handling mode switching between focus and break sessions, to wiring up the EXP bar animation that rewards users after each completed session and I also designed the Bluey and Bingo theme.)
